{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"similar-snowdrop","update":{"sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"exec:0#8d61d806ff0a4da993ec69d1dd8453f9","status":"in_progress","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"<!doctype html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Meridian</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/ui/styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header id=\"honesty\"></header>\n<div id=\"app\">\n  <aside id=\"rail\">\n    <h2>ROSTER <span id=\"frameTag\"></span></h2>\n    <div id=\"roster\"></div>\n    <button id=\"mintBtn\">+ mint personality</button>\n    <button id=\"allChatBtn\">ALL CHAT</button>\n  </aside>\n  <main>\n    <nav id=\"tabs\">\n      <button data-tab=\"chat\" class=\"on\">Chat</button>\n      <button data-tab=\"command\">Command</button>\n      <button data-tab=\"library\">Library</button>\n      <button data-tab=\"workshops\">Workshops</button>\n      <button data-tab=\"exchange\">Exchange</button>\n      <button data-tab=\"settings\">Settings</button>\n      <button data-tab=\"log\">Log</button>\n    </nav>\n    <section id=\"tab-chat\">\n      <div id=\"chathead\"></div>\n      <div id=\"feed\"></div>\n      <div id=\"composer\">\n        <button id=\"mic\" title=\"push to talk (browser Web Speech API, or declared-none)\">&#x1F3A4;</button>\n        <input id=\"msg\" placeholder=\"type an input — requests work AND conversation\">\n        <button id=\"send\">send</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section id=\"tab-command\" class=\"hidden\">\n      <div class=\"cols\">\n        <div><h3>Projects <button id=\"newProj\">+ create project</button></h3><div id=\"projects\"></div></div>\n        <div><h3>Open needs (queue)</h3><div id=\"needs\"></div></div>\n        <div><h3>Focus / calendar</h3><div id=\"focus\"></div><div id=\"cal\"></div>\n          <h3>Grant requests</h3><div id=\"grantReqs\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section id=\"tab-library\" class=\"hidden\">\n      <div class=\"cols\">\n        <div><h3>Assertion browser</h3>\n          <input id=\"libq\" placeholder=\"search ledger text\"><button id=\"libSearch\">search</button>\n          <select id=\"libns\"><option value=\"\">(all predicates)</option></select>\n          <div id=\"librows\"></div></div>\n        <div><h3>Computed view</h3>\n\u001b[0m[... 61 lines omitted ...]\n.persona .imit{background:var(--warn);color:#000;font-size:9px;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700}\nbutton{background:var(--acc);color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px}\nbutton:hover{filter:brightness(1.15)}\n#rail button{width:100%;margin-top:6px}\n#allChatBtn{background:#5a4ea1}\nmain{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}\n#tabs{display:flex;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel)}\n#tabs button{background:transparent;color:var(--dim);border-radius:0;padding:9px 16px}\n#tabs button.on{color:var(--fg);border-bottom:2px solid var(--acc)}\nsection{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px}\n.hidden{display:none}\n#chathead{color:var(--dim);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px}\n#feed{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding-bottom:10px}\n.bubble{max-width:78%;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.bubble.user{align-self:flex-end;background:#1d2c3a}\n.bubble.persona{align-self:flex-start;background:var(--panel)}\n.bubble .who{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:3px}\n.bubble .meta{font-size:10px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:3px}\n.card{align-self:center;border:1px dashed var(--warn);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 14px;color:var(--warn);font-size:12\u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nx;background:#1a160e}\n.card.witness{border-color:#4ea15e;color:#7fc78a}\n.card.workshop{border-color:var(--acc);color:var(--acc)}\n#composer{display:flex;gap:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px;background:var(--panel)}\n#composer input{flex:1;background:#0d1116;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;color:var(--fg);padding:8px}\n.cols{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start}\n.cols>div{flex:1;min-width:0}\n.cols h3{font-size:13px;color:var(--acc);margin:8px 0}\ninput,textarea,select{background:#0d1116;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;color:var(--fg);padding:6px;mar\u001b[0mg\u001b[0m\nin:2px 0;width:100%;font:inherit}\ntextarea{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px}\npre{background:#0d1116;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:8px;overflow-x:auto;font-size:11px;max-he\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\nght:60vh;overflow-y:auto}\n.need,.proj,.grant,.tool{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px;margin-bottom:8px;background:var(--\u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nanel)}\n.need .st{color:var(--warn)}\n.kv{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim)}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;width:100%}\ntd,th{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:3px 7px;text-align:left}\n.field label{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);display:block;margin-top:6px}\n.req{color:var(--bad)}\n.ok{color:#7fc78a}\n.small{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim)}\n.slotbox{border-left:2px solid var(--line);padding-left:8px;margin:6px 0}\n@echo off\nREM Meridian launcher — documented procedure in LAUNCH.md\ncd /d \"%~dp0\"\npython -m app --port 9760 --open\n# Launch procedure — Meridian (version 0.3.0.002)\n\nRequirements: Windows + Python 3.10+ on PATH (no pip installs, stdlib only).\n\n## One-line launch\n\n```\nlaunch.cmd\n```\n\nor, equivalently:\n\n```\ncd \"version 0.3.0.002\"\npython -m app --port 9760 --open\n```\n\n## What a clean launch looks like\n\n1. Console prints the honesty banner: `ledger: durable`, engine modes\n   (`llm`, `tts`, `stt`, `portrait`), stub declarations, persona frame, and the\n   surface URL.\n2. A launch log is written to `evidence/launch/launch-<timestamp>.log` and a\n   machine-readable report to `runtime/last-launch.json` with `\"ok\": true`.\n3. The browser opens `http://127.0.0.1:9760` — the honesty banner at the top\n   carries the same engine modes and stub declarations (nothing is silent).\n4. `launch:report` and `launch:honesty` assertions are appended to the ledger\n   (visible in the Library tab).\n\n## Flags\n\n| Flag | Effect |\n|------|--------|\n| `--port N` | serve on port N (default 9760) |\n| `--runtime DIR` | use an alternate runtime dir |\n| `--no-steward` | do not start the background steward thread |\n| `--no-serve` | boot everything, skip the HTTP surface (used by demo harness) |\n| `--open` | open the browser |\n\n## Verification without the browser\n\n```\npython scripts\\probe.py\n```\n\n`probe.py` launches a second instance on port 9761, polls `/api/state` and\n`/api/honesty`, proves steward responsiveness while the server answers, writes\n`evidence/launch/probe-<timestamp>.json`, and exits — no manual env vars.\n\n## Stopping\n\nCtrl+C in the console, or close the window. The ledger is durable JSONL —\nstate survives restart (demonstration 8 in `evidence/demos/`)."}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec","cognition.ai/terminalPreview":true}}}}
