{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"similar-snowdrop","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I've got enough context to design the implementation plan. I'll create a new file, `app/gate.py`, to handle the interactive readiness gate. The `run_gate` function will check input readiness, ensuring primitive pipelines and LLM handles accept input, and that the ledger is ready. This gate's pass time will be recorded in `runtime/gate.json` and included in the launch report and API state. I'll also create a dedicated launch file, `runtime/launch-partition.jsonl`, for the Ledger's two-phase mount on boot."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:07:12.961653600+00:00"}}}}
