{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"similar-snowdrop","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I'm organizing the governance namespaces. It looks like `chat:context` should go under the `chat` namespace, not `governance`. The `email` namespace will cover `email:message`, `email:imported`, and `email:context`. For `inference`, I'll use `inference:snapshot` and `inference:commit`. The `gate` namespace will include `gate:check` and `gate:passed`. The `ui` namespace already has `shell-theme`, which is suitable for themes."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:08:05.600798700+00:00"}}}}
