{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"similar-snowdrop","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I'm refining the `builtins.py` module, adding helper functions like `current_context` and `current_focus`. I'm also defining several new tools: `chat-reset` for clearing chat state, `select-context` for setting context and persona, `focus-need` for managing focus, `persona-update` for editable persona fields, and `serve-response-need` for handling responses. The `compose_for` function will be updated to accept a `snap` argument and inject persona conditioning, context, and snapshot reads. I'm also considering how to structure persona data, potentially adding a `style` object within the `lens` to hold styleCard and responsibilities. The system prompt for `compose_for` will be dynamically built to include persona name, styleCard details, traits, interests, responsibilities, and guidance."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:09:36.824453200+00:00"}}}}
