{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"similar-snowdrop","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I've confirmed the API is complete, noting that `ctx.invoke` likely wraps function tool results in a standard `{\"ok\": ..., \"result\": ...}` format, as seen with `/api/chat/reset`. Now, I'm focusing on the UI overhaul, which involves updating `index.html`, `styles.css`, and `app.js` to implement several new features: a status bar, theme switching with four options, an Inbox tab for email commentary, a conversation reset button, enhanced context display in the chat header, a personality editor, and improvements to the personality roster. I'll also adjust the default theme to light and manage SSE events by keeping the current polling mechanism."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:14:00.633690700+00:00"}}}}
