{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"similar-snowdrop","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"It looks like the `/api/exchange/export` endpoint returns the raw result from `ctx.invoke(\"export-exchange\", body)`, but other API endpoints, like `/api/compare`, wrap the result in `{\"ok\":..., \"result\":...}` and then extract the result. This inconsistency might be causing issues, especially if older code expects the wrapped format. I need to check the exact return shape of `tools.invoke` to understand how it's handling these results."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:15:19.608807700+00:00"}}}}
