{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"similar-snowdrop","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"It looks like `launch-check.py` needs to cover G4/S-windows-launch/S-close-terminate, and I'll update `launch.cmd` for an \"installed program\" feel using `--open`. The scenario driver plan seems solid, covering everything from assertions and template needs to candidate ranking, project listing, personality creation, background presentation, competing tools, restart recovery, exchange imports, deferred publication, and chat invocations. I'll proceed with implementing these scenarios."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:16:01.896322900+00:00"}}}}
