{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"similar-snowdrop","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"The scenarios runtime passing `--no-watchdog` is good, preventing self-termination. However, a previous run's `runtime/scenario` directory could prevent fresh seeding, so I'll clear it in `main()` for deterministic persona counts. The `/api/tools/persona.speak/invoke` path correctly accepts the system command. I also need to verify the `/api/candidates?subject=` GET route and its parameter name against the route list."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:17:28.774675800+00:00"}}}}
