{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"similar-snowdrop","update":{"sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"exec:0#0c59728c15d74f3badfa1c424894458a","status":"in_progress","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n## Turn chain & surfaces\n\n| Capability | Class | Where |\n|---|---|---|\n| Chat turn: captured-input assertion → decision-model intents → `need:tool-request` per intent + `need:response` → dra\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\nn → compose → `persona.speak` card | parity | `fn_run_chat_turn` |\n| One input can open several tool opportunities AND a conversation response | parity | `fn_parse_chat` |\n| Cards feed (persona / offer / witness kinds) routed via bus, replayable | parity | `host.Bus`, UI feed |\n| Chat lane: clear-chat boundary marker (append-only), set/close topic, all-chat flag | parity | chat lane tools |\n| Cross-turn memory: history since last clear-chat read into compose prompts — on all conversation paths | parity+ (the\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\nr open deficit) | `chat_history` |\n| Web UI: chat, roster, command center, library, workshops, exchange, settings, log; honesty banner | parity-level | `a\u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\np/ui/` |\n| **Command center: projects + open-need queue + focus/calendar + grant requests on one surface; explicit create-projec\u001b[0mt\u001b[0m\n affordance** | **new (A4)** | Command tab |\n| **Library: assertion browser/search + computed-view inspector + append-only assertion editing (supersession supported\u001b[0m)\u001b[0m\n** | **new (B: library-mediated editing)** | Library tab, `/api/library/*` |\n| **Workshops: one generic renderer derives forms from `tool.template` (relationship-driven form derivation); proficien\u001b[0mc\u001b[0m\ny tier disclosure** | **new (B / A10)** | `openWorkshop`, `set-editor-proficiency` |\n| Mic: browser Web Speech → `device:speech-transcript` witness → turn; absent API declared, not faked | parity | UI mic\u001b[0m,\u001b[0m\n `transcribe-speech` |\n| TTS: `speak-voice` ranks renderers; local SAPI synthesis with per-persona voice/rate | parity | `fn_speak_voice` |\n| **Speech floor (F6/C-SpeechFloor): serialized FIFO playback admission — one render at a time; every admission + playb\u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\nck is a ledger assertion (`speech:floor-admission`, `speech:floor-played`)** | **new (F6)** | `app/speechfloor.py`, `cm\u001b[0md\u001b[0m\n_persona_speak` |\n| **Sequential respondents (F6): ranked roster order = speaking order; each reply card + floor admission carries its se\u001b[0mq\u001b[0m\nuence; `decision:respondent` rows record it** | **new (F6)** | `fn_serve_response_need` |\n| **Speech as independently-defined competing tools (local `render-speech-sapi` vs remote `render-speech-remote`, both \u001b[0mn\u001b[0m\need `speech.render`, ranked by outcomes; remote honestly unconfigured)** | **new (A13)** | speech tools |\n| Soundscape / camera / gallery theater | **absent** | declared |\n\n## Stewardship, projects, sources\n\n| Capability | Class | Where |\n|---|---|---|\n| Background steward: daemon thread running `steward-tick` tool; drains needs, countdown needs, calendar scan, source-c\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\nnfidence, compact-check; each run recorded (`idle:steward-run`, ms) | parity | `app/steward.py`, `fn_steward_tick` |\n| **Stewardship configurable as ledger data: duties + interval via `assign-stewardship` (`routing:stewardship-assignmen\u001b[0mt\u001b[0m\n`), per-duty toggles** | **new (A3 / D-IdleTurnAsTool)** | `assign-stewardship`, Settings |\n| Responsiveness: steward never holds request path; probe measures API answer while tick runs | parity | `steward.py`, \u001b[0mp\u001b[0m\nrobe |\n| Projects: `project:*` subjects, goals as assertions, goals → linked needs, progress visible; create via chat | parity\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\n| `_create_project`, Command tab |\n| **Goal→need decomposition + project-linked queue/progress states user-facing** | **new (A4/B)** | `/api/projects`, de\u001b[0mm\u00