itutes silently.\n- `mail.outbox_write` writes `.eml` artifacts to `runtime/outbox/` — it claims\n  local queueing, never network delivery.\n- Host-backed `fn` tools are marked `hasFn` in the component manifest (a\n  declared divergence from the reference's all-data posture for\n  orchestrators); user-authored tools are data-only and validated.\n","_meta":{"cognition.ai/linesAdded":1,"cognition.ai/linesRemoved":1}}],"rawInput":{"file_path":"C:\\builds\\project\\version 0.3.0.003\\FEATURES.md","old_string":"| Mint/edit persona; **unique generated art per persona** — motif family from interests, palette from identity, ambient SVG motion, portrait frame, artifact + `persona:art` assertion (C-PersonalityArt / C-PresentationGlass) | **new (F7)** | `app/art.py`, `fn_generate_portrait` |","new_string":"| Mint/edit persona; **unique portrait art per persona** — procedurally illustrated bust (face shape, skin, hair style+color, eyes, brows, mouth, glasses/collar) seeded from identity + motif/palette/frame as ground; ambient SVG motion; artifact + `persona:art` assertion with portrait params (C-PersonalityArt / C-PresentationGlass / G2) | **new (F7/G2)** | `app/art.py`, `fn_generate_portrait` |"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/suppressApproval":true,"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"edit","cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-22T08:29:59.291011800+00:00"}}}}
